WEBVTT

01:26.060 --> 01:31.590
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.190 --> 01:39.560
[Episode 29: A Mysterious Situation]

01:42.910 --> 01:44.670
How much did you drink?

01:57.790 --> 01:59.509
You won't leave me alone.

02:01.710 --> 02:04.360
Why are you still messing with me?

02:06.460 --> 02:08.710
Tell me. Why did you come?

02:10.250 --> 02:11.700
Go away!

02:16.170 --> 02:18.440
I'm here to tell you something serious.

03:15.310 --> 03:17.030
How much did you drink?

04:14.990 --> 04:16.440
For so long,

04:21.190 --> 04:25.530
I've confirmed a suspicion that I'd long had.

04:29.270 --> 04:30.720
From the beginning,

04:31.750 --> 04:33.780
it was your plan to show up

04:34.950 --> 04:36.800
at the gambling house in Baiju Town, right?

04:43.230 --> 04:45.110
When Mr. Wen was imprisoned

04:45.370 --> 04:47.390
at the salt mine prison,

04:49.030 --> 04:50.480
I knew someone from Yuntai

04:51.510 --> 04:53.939
would rescue him.

04:56.100 --> 04:57.550
Then, you showed up

04:58.650 --> 05:01.040
in Yan Luowang's study room.

05:02.550 --> 05:04.600
It was too coincidental.

05:05.550 --> 05:07.520
It's hard not to be suspicious.

05:09.930 --> 05:11.380
But it's strange.

05:14.300 --> 05:15.810
The heart changes with time.

05:18.230 --> 05:20.230
I don't know when

05:21.640 --> 05:23.410
I started to convince myself.

05:24.790 --> 05:26.240
I have to trust you.

05:26.670 --> 05:27.470
But I know

05:27.470 --> 05:29.630
everything you asked me to do

05:30.620 --> 05:32.450
was just you using me

05:32.830 --> 05:34.580
to help you get rid of your dissidents.

05:35.990 --> 05:37.870
If I'm not mistaken,

05:38.680 --> 05:40.970
there's some internal conflict in Lingyuan.

05:42.950 --> 05:44.610
So you came to me

05:50.980 --> 05:52.850
because you wanted to use me to kill someone.

05:55.200 --> 05:57.140
Since you've seen through it all,

05:58.030 --> 06:00.070
why didn't you ask me to leave?

06:02.670 --> 06:04.120
What do you think?

06:08.770 --> 06:10.430
Actually, I really want to know

06:13.320 --> 06:15.270
if you hadn't met me

06:16.500 --> 06:18.380
at the gambling house in Baiju Town,

06:19.500 --> 06:21.090
and met one my fellows instead,

06:23.330 --> 06:25.310
would it had been the same for you?

06:26.550 --> 06:28.000
Yun Xiang.

06:28.900 --> 06:30.820
I never meant to harm you.

06:32.770 --> 06:34.220
I believe you.

06:36.660 --> 06:38.860
You lied to me and used me,

06:40.280 --> 06:42.530
but you never hurt me.

06:44.210 --> 06:45.660
Do you know that day

06:46.200 --> 06:48.280
when you left without saying goodbye,

06:49.150 --> 06:50.600
I was in so much pain?

06:51.270 --> 06:55.446
But later I realized

06:55.470 --> 06:56.920
that you have been

06:57.430 --> 06:59.970
this clean and sharp.

07:01.030 --> 07:02.530
Once her hand's up, she slices with her sword in an instant.

07:02.980 --> 07:04.610
You are never indecisive.

07:06.680 --> 07:08.390
That's what I like about you.

07:09.690 --> 07:11.140
That's you.

07:12.400 --> 07:13.666
Stop talking about it.

07:13.690 --> 07:15.340
It's meaningless.

07:15.500 --> 07:17.910
I'm here today to tell you something important.

07:18.870 --> 07:20.470
It's meaningless to you.

07:21.670 --> 07:23.120
It's meaningful to me.

07:30.900 --> 07:32.350
Tell me.

07:34.790 --> 07:36.500
You've been with me for so long.

07:39.030 --> 07:41.110
Have you been acting all along?

07:43.250 --> 07:45.180
You've been pretending.

07:46.290 --> 07:48.610
You never really liked me.

07:56.820 --> 07:59.110
What's the problem in Lingyuan Sect?

07:59.549 --> 08:01.940
Tell me what's going on.

08:02.710 --> 08:04.230
I'll take care of it for you.

08:04.700 --> 08:07.170
I hope when everything is back to normal,

08:09.030 --> 08:10.700
you can come back to me.

08:11.550 --> 08:13.000
OK?

08:16.350 --> 08:17.930
I really can't.

08:25.090 --> 08:26.630
What do you mean?

08:29.020 --> 08:30.470
If you broke Lingyuan Sect's rules,

08:30.470 --> 08:32.110
I'll help you get out of it.

08:32.189 --> 08:33.230
If anyone is targeting you,

08:33.230 --> 08:34.846
I can help you get rid of him.

08:34.870 --> 08:36.230
As long as our hearts are together,

08:36.230 --> 08:37.360
we can solve everything.

08:37.380 --> 08:39.300
We can overcome all difficulties.

08:40.340 --> 08:41.996
Just like you coming here tonight.

08:42.020 --> 08:42.905
Aren't you worried

08:42.929 --> 08:44.940
someone from Lingyyuan is following you?

08:45.900 --> 08:47.366
I won't be here if I'm scared.

08:47.390 --> 08:48.840
That's right.

08:49.580 --> 08:51.396
This is the Shu Yanan I know.

08:51.420 --> 08:52.870
You're wrong.

08:54.310 --> 08:55.840
My name is Kou Lianyi.

09:02.410 --> 09:06.110
Lingyuan Sect's Madam Kou gave birth to a son and a daughter.

09:07.980 --> 09:09.770
Her son's name is Kou Yuanjie.

09:11.090 --> 09:12.720
Her daughter's name is Kou Lianyi.

09:13.540 --> 09:14.990
So what?

09:15.130 --> 09:16.730
The eldest daughter of the Lingyuan Sect's master.

09:19.420 --> 09:21.290
Let's start over, okay?

09:23.820 --> 09:26.420
I shoulder the responsibility for the hundred-year foundation of Lingyuan Sect,

09:27.310 --> 09:29.350
and the Kou family who are in danger.

09:29.470 --> 09:31.350
I need to listen to Mother.

09:32.030 --> 09:33.710
But fate played a trick on me.

09:34.160 --> 09:37.230
I wanted to use you to confront someone.

09:37.900 --> 09:40.900
Mother now wants us to form an alliance against you.

09:41.780 --> 09:44.190
This is what I wanted to tell you today.

09:45.230 --> 09:46.750
From now on,

09:49.190 --> 09:50.870
I'm your enemy.

09:58.560 --> 10:00.200
Forget about Shu Yanan.

10:00.590 --> 10:02.350
That wasn't me.

10:03.630 --> 10:06.100
Then why are you wearing the hairpin I gave you?

10:16.070 --> 10:19.980
♫ It's dark but friends are not back ♫

10:21.050 --> 10:25.260
♫ The night breeze can't understand sadness and heartache ♫

10:25.770 --> 10:29.530
♫ Rain falls all night long and I stay awake ♫

10:30.740 --> 10:35.070
♫ The night rain can't conceal the sorrow ♫

10:35.310 --> 10:39.560
♫ Memory is a book ♫

10:40.120 --> 10:44.740
♫ Who wrote all those stories ♫

10:45.100 --> 10:49.340
♫ Without realizing it ♫

10:49.720 --> 10:54.296
♫ So many years have passed ♫

10:54.320 --> 10:57.720
♫ Flowers fall into the garden ♫

10:58.070 --> 11:03.186
♫ Dear friends, why haven't we met earlier ♫

11:03.210 --> 11:11.880
♫ Destiny is so cruel ♫

11:12.850 --> 11:15.886
♫ The cloud disperses and mountains are seen ♫

11:15.910 --> 11:18.196
♫ How many old friends are gone ♫

11:18.220 --> 11:23.086
♫ I raise my cup to beckon the bright moon ♫

11:23.110 --> 11:25.456
♫ People I miss are thousands of miles away ♫

11:25.480 --> 11:27.836
♫ We let go of the past ♫

11:27.860 --> 11:32.860
♫ Stories take place thousands of miles away ♫

11:33.470 --> 11:35.330
His name is Nangong Fang.

11:35.810 --> 11:37.470
He is not weaker than you are.

11:39.030 --> 11:40.520
Be careful.

11:40.560 --> 11:43.466
♫ The cloud disperses and mountains are seen ♫

11:43.490 --> 11:45.896
♫ How many old friends are gone ♫

11:45.920 --> 11:50.686
♫ I raise my cup to beckon the bright moon ♫

11:50.710 --> 11:52.930
♫ A cloud of dust and a lot of love ♫

11:52.950 --> 11:55.506
♫ We let go of the past ♫

11:55.530 --> 12:00.316
♫ Stories take place thousands of miles away ♫

12:00.340 --> 12:02.716
♫ The cloud disperses and mountains are seen ♫

12:02.740 --> 12:05.016
♫ How many old friends are gone ♫

12:05.040 --> 12:09.946
♫ I raise my cup to beckon the bright moon ♫

12:09.970 --> 12:12.266
♫ A cloud of dust and a lot of love ♫

12:12.290 --> 12:14.716
♫ We let go of the past ♫

12:14.740 --> 12:19.786
♫ Stories take place thousands of miles away ♫

12:19.810 --> 12:29.920
♫ Stories take place thousands of miles away ♫

12:30.470 --> 12:34.790
[Guanghui Bank]

12:50.710 --> 12:52.116
Who was that?

12:52.140 --> 12:53.176
In the middle of the night?

12:53.200 --> 12:55.770
Are you moving your graves?

12:56.130 --> 12:57.660
What are you doing?

13:01.180 --> 13:02.630
Be careful.

13:04.710 --> 13:06.566
They were still open during the day.

13:06.590 --> 13:08.620
When was it sold?

13:10.070 --> 13:12.150
It's really ridiculous.

13:12.510 --> 13:14.160
Hello, Mr. Mo.

13:25.710 --> 13:27.160
Who are you?

13:28.100 --> 13:30.446
I'm nobody.

13:30.470 --> 13:31.766
What an honor.

13:31.790 --> 13:35.110
Please call me Mr. Nangong.

13:36.410 --> 13:38.220
Did you do this?

13:38.720 --> 13:40.696
I was in a hurry to open a shop tomorrow,

13:40.720 --> 13:42.876
so I had no choice but to build it overnight.

13:42.900 --> 13:44.116
If I'm disturbing you,

13:44.140 --> 13:46.040
I'm very sorry.

13:47.990 --> 13:51.700
You're not from Nandu, right?

13:52.770 --> 13:54.620
You're sharp, Mr. Mo.

13:54.720 --> 13:56.590
I just arrived in Nandu.

13:56.670 --> 13:59.306
I heard this is a good place.

13:59.330 --> 14:01.076
I want to get some luck

14:01.100 --> 14:02.780
by being next to Guanghui Bank.

14:05.110 --> 14:06.620
You have good taste.

14:06.660 --> 14:09.666
What kind of business are you going to do?

14:09.690 --> 14:11.140
I'm opening a bank.

14:15.030 --> 14:17.820
[Dafeng Bank]

14:19.930 --> 14:22.250
[Dafeng Bank]

14:23.190 --> 14:23.990
Hurry up!

14:23.990 --> 14:25.440
Let's go.

14:25.670 --> 14:27.140
So many people.

14:43.270 --> 14:44.720
What are you doing?

14:44.870 --> 14:46.320
Get to work.

14:59.230 --> 15:00.566
Uncle.

15:00.590 --> 15:02.206
Have some tea to calm down.

15:02.230 --> 15:03.966
What tea? Why calm down?

15:03.990 --> 15:05.070
We have been open for four hours.

15:05.070 --> 15:06.710
There were only few people here.

15:06.900 --> 15:08.916
No one would deposit money every day.

15:08.940 --> 15:11.440
It's not surprising that we don't have business for half a day.

15:11.990 --> 15:12.966
Here.

15:12.990 --> 15:14.926
You know how to lie through your teeth now, yeah?

15:14.950 --> 15:16.400
Follow me.

15:18.870 --> 15:20.320
Look.

15:20.350 --> 15:22.510
You're talking nonsense during the day. Look.

15:22.580 --> 15:24.756
Why do they have so many people there?

15:24.780 --> 15:25.956
It's their opening day today.

15:25.980 --> 15:27.860
They must have hired someone to support the scene.

15:28.530 --> 15:29.980
Let's take a look.

15:37.990 --> 15:38.966
Sir,

15:38.990 --> 15:41.146
what are you doing here?

15:41.170 --> 15:43.206
I'm making a deposit. Obviously.

15:43.230 --> 15:44.406
Guanghui Bank is on the opposite side.

15:44.430 --> 15:45.926
Why do you have to wait here?

15:45.950 --> 15:47.146
Haven't you heard about it?

15:47.170 --> 15:48.086
Stop asking.

15:48.110 --> 15:49.526
Go back home and get the money.

15:49.550 --> 15:50.926
Deposit it here.

15:50.950 --> 15:51.870
The owner of Dafeng Bank

15:51.870 --> 15:53.046
came from Yangzhou.

15:53.070 --> 15:55.166
He said he wanted to make friends with the people of Nandu.

15:55.190 --> 15:56.070
Within three days,

15:56.070 --> 15:57.566
anyone who deposits money in his bank

15:57.590 --> 15:59.326
for a fixed term of three months

15:59.350 --> 16:01.110
will receive ten percent of interest.

16:01.290 --> 16:02.926
I've never heard of

16:02.950 --> 16:04.086
a bank offering ten percent of interest.

16:04.110 --> 16:05.110
Since ancient times,

16:05.110 --> 16:07.106
It's already a huge benefit that banks are not charging handling fees.

16:07.130 --> 16:08.536
Why would they give out interest?

16:08.560 --> 16:10.010
It's up to you to believe it or not.

16:19.860 --> 16:21.880
Lady Yanan, please don't worry.

16:23.060 --> 16:27.326
Mo Bufan will accept the challenge.

16:27.350 --> 16:28.806
How is he doing business?

16:28.830 --> 16:30.206
We do business for money.

16:30.230 --> 16:32.350
He's obviously targeting me.

16:32.670 --> 16:33.866
What's happening lately?

16:33.890 --> 16:35.816
It's so hard to live a peaceful life.

16:35.840 --> 16:36.806
At this rate,

16:36.830 --> 16:38.666
all of the money in our bank will be withdrawn,

16:38.690 --> 16:39.926
and moved to his bank.

16:39.950 --> 16:40.726
Yeah.

16:40.750 --> 16:42.736
Take out all the money and keep it in his.

16:42.760 --> 16:44.346
Let's see if he can accept it.

16:44.370 --> 16:46.056
To confront Yun Xiang,

16:46.080 --> 16:47.806
you have to deal with Su Mingyu and Mo Bufan.

16:47.830 --> 16:49.200
It’s reasonable

16:49.220 --> 16:50.970
to start with Guanghui Bank.

16:51.710 --> 16:53.710
But Mo Bufan is very sophisticated.

16:54.090 --> 16:56.156
I'm afraid he won't take the bait so easily.

16:56.180 --> 16:57.526
Lady Yanan.

16:57.550 --> 16:59.730
I've never failed

17:00.750 --> 17:02.600
when I take action personally.

17:05.209 --> 17:06.916
If he finds out,

17:06.940 --> 17:09.126
he'll ask the customers to come to us

17:09.150 --> 17:10.566
and withdraw their money.

17:10.590 --> 17:12.099
Then we will...

17:12.160 --> 17:13.566
He clearly has ill intentions.

17:13.590 --> 17:14.906
Should I...

17:14.930 --> 17:16.286
I stay here

17:16.310 --> 17:17.990
and wait for it to happen?

17:19.259 --> 17:21.330
Why don't we discuss it with Mr. Yun?

17:24.440 --> 17:26.960
What? Do you have a backup plan?

17:28.030 --> 17:30.330
I can't tell you.

17:30.750 --> 17:33.136
I heard that Lady Yanan

17:33.160 --> 17:36.206
had a great conversation with Mr. Yun last night.

17:36.230 --> 17:39.250
If you accidentally leak the news,

17:39.590 --> 17:42.230
my efforts will all be in vain.

17:47.230 --> 17:49.976
I had my reasons to see him.

17:50.000 --> 17:52.000
Mr. Nangong, please don't worry.

17:52.420 --> 17:54.460
The priority is the interest of Lingyuan Sect.

17:55.220 --> 17:56.766
Since I was ordered to assist you,

17:56.790 --> 17:58.420
I will devote myself to it.

17:58.560 --> 18:00.670
You're clearly enemies,

18:00.820 --> 18:03.020
but you still wanted to meet him.

18:03.980 --> 18:06.170
So affectionate.

18:06.950 --> 18:08.986
I'm so jealous.

18:09.010 --> 18:10.710
Don't be bitter.

18:14.330 --> 18:16.746
I always speak in this manner.

18:16.770 --> 18:19.720
Please forgive me.

18:21.930 --> 18:25.080
That day, you said you came for the title of the royal supplier of silk

18:25.420 --> 18:27.166
But even if we defeat Mo Bufan,

18:27.190 --> 18:30.426
the foundation of the Su family won't be affected at all.

18:30.450 --> 18:32.440
Don’t worry.

18:34.480 --> 18:35.856
Right now,

18:35.880 --> 18:37.330
the Su family

18:38.610 --> 18:40.566
is already in danger.

18:40.590 --> 18:44.086
In the name of the Emperor, the imperial edict says

18:44.110 --> 18:48.966
Su Mingyu, the chairman of Nandu Chamber of Commerce,

18:48.990 --> 18:51.436
delayed the capital tribute

18:51.460 --> 18:53.126
and then lost it.

18:53.150 --> 18:54.186
Here.

18:54.210 --> 18:55.606
From now on,

18:55.630 --> 18:57.456
the Su family's royal silk supplier procurement certificate

18:57.480 --> 19:01.086
will be suspended immediately.

19:01.110 --> 19:05.750
We will evaluate and pick the best textile mill in Nandu

19:05.750 --> 19:07.366
and retitle them as the royal supplier

19:07.390 --> 19:09.586
to deliver the royal tribute.

19:09.610 --> 19:11.850
The end of the announcement.

19:12.270 --> 19:15.400
It is my honor to accept it.

19:18.150 --> 19:20.230
Mingyu, come.

19:32.060 --> 19:33.286
Mingyu.

19:33.310 --> 19:35.030
I know

19:35.790 --> 19:37.470
this time,

19:38.480 --> 19:40.070
you were wronged.

19:41.510 --> 19:43.416
I wonder

19:43.440 --> 19:46.270
who provoked His Majesty.

19:46.770 --> 19:48.486
Actually beforehand,

19:48.510 --> 19:51.436
I even submitted a statement

19:51.460 --> 19:53.540
to plead for you.

19:54.350 --> 19:55.800
But

19:56.710 --> 19:59.960
I can't disobey His Majesty's order.

20:00.590 --> 20:02.420
Don't blame me.

20:03.860 --> 20:05.026
Uncle Liu,

20:05.050 --> 20:06.830
what are you talking about?

20:08.010 --> 20:09.690
His Majesty has shown mercy

20:09.830 --> 20:11.390
by giving the Su family a chance

20:11.520 --> 20:13.606
to compete again in the future.

20:13.630 --> 20:15.550
You didn't know.

20:15.670 --> 20:20.360
Actually, there are

20:21.830 --> 20:24.290
two edicts.

20:27.150 --> 20:28.600
Mr. Yun.

20:31.550 --> 20:33.000
Mr. Yun!

20:36.350 --> 20:37.800
Mr. Yun!

20:50.350 --> 20:50.870
What's wrong?

20:50.870 --> 20:52.470
Something happened to Mingyu.

20:53.390 --> 20:54.840
It happened.

20:57.840 --> 21:01.850
In the name of the Emperor, the imperial edict says

21:01.940 --> 21:04.826
Su Mingyu, Chairman of Nandu Chamber of Commerce,

21:04.850 --> 21:07.586
has recently neglected his duty.

21:07.610 --> 21:10.606
You merchants were engaged in farming,

21:10.630 --> 21:12.316
only to make profit.

21:12.340 --> 21:15.146
The imperial court was generous enough

21:15.170 --> 21:17.580
to allow the convenience of trade.

21:16.830 --> 21:20.690
[Nandu Chamber of Commerce]

21:17.750 --> 21:20.986
You weren't grateful and content at all,

21:21.010 --> 21:23.086
and colluded with the Chamber of Commerce.

21:23.110 --> 21:25.246
causing the silk price in Nandu to skyrocket.

21:25.270 --> 21:26.846
The people are complaining.

21:26.870 --> 21:27.556
Therefore,

21:27.580 --> 21:31.846
from today onwards, the Nandu Chamber of Commerce will be closed down

21:31.870 --> 21:33.950
as a warning to others.

21:33.220 --> 21:37.200
[May 30, 1941, Tianqing]

21:34.290 --> 21:36.480
The end of the announcement.

21:44.590 --> 21:46.040
Don't be afraid.

21:46.900 --> 21:48.790
Even if you want to start over,

21:49.070 --> 21:50.520
I'll be with you.

21:55.690 --> 21:57.140
Mingyu,

21:58.270 --> 21:59.950
you're so calm.

22:00.390 --> 22:01.840
I didn't expect you to be so calm.

22:03.490 --> 22:04.940
But

22:06.400 --> 22:07.890
the current crisis

22:08.390 --> 22:10.790
can't be resolved

22:10.910 --> 22:12.460
by us comforting each other.

22:17.740 --> 22:20.006
But this is His Majesty's edict.

22:20.030 --> 22:22.160
How else can we solve it?

22:22.310 --> 22:24.190
Two imperial edicts in a row

22:24.590 --> 22:26.870
have affected the foundation of the Su family.

22:28.280 --> 22:30.050
But have you ever thought

22:30.990 --> 22:32.820
of the third

22:33.760 --> 22:35.400
and fourth imperial edicts?

22:37.760 --> 22:38.766
What should we do then?

22:38.790 --> 22:40.310
You mean...

22:41.970 --> 22:43.650
someone is targeting the Su family?

22:46.710 --> 22:48.600
Only government officials can ask

22:49.680 --> 22:51.640
His Majesty to issue the imperial edict.

22:53.790 --> 22:54.760
But we're in business.

22:54.780 --> 22:57.270
We focus on harmony and wealth.

22:57.960 --> 22:59.520
The Su family especially

22:59.790 --> 23:00.966
has been carefully maintaining

23:00.990 --> 23:02.886
the relationship with the government.

23:02.910 --> 23:05.070
Mr. Yun, in this case,

23:06.470 --> 23:08.260
is there anyone who's suspicious?

23:10.670 --> 23:12.120
Manager Ke,

23:12.350 --> 23:13.676
please take a break from work

23:13.700 --> 23:15.210
for the time being,

23:15.350 --> 23:16.850
and spend more time with Mingyu.

23:18.230 --> 23:19.720
I'll investigate it now.

23:19.820 --> 23:22.390
I'll let you know if there's any news.

23:30.050 --> 23:31.770
His name is Nangong Fang.

23:32.390 --> 23:33.950
He is not weaker than you are.

23:35.370 --> 23:36.920
Be careful.

23:46.440 --> 23:47.890
Yun Xiang.

23:49.030 --> 23:50.146
Did you come from the Su Residence?

23:50.170 --> 23:51.620
You know about it?

23:51.670 --> 23:52.846
I can’t help you

23:52.870 --> 23:54.636
on the Su family's matter.

23:54.660 --> 23:56.996
I have an urgent matter to solve.

23:57.020 --> 23:58.056
A bank was built overnight

23:58.080 --> 24:00.086
right accross Guanghui Bank.

24:00.110 --> 24:01.076
He came with ill intentions.

24:01.100 --> 24:02.206
He's very aggressive.

24:02.230 --> 24:05.010
The owner of the bank is Nangong Fang.

24:05.790 --> 24:07.470
Have you seen him?

24:08.070 --> 24:09.266
I saw him once.

24:09.290 --> 24:10.336
He was hiding malice behind his smile.

24:10.360 --> 24:12.130
He's not an ordinary person.

24:12.290 --> 24:13.716
I asked someone to investigate him.

24:13.740 --> 24:15.006
He may be living behind the scenes,

24:15.030 --> 24:17.766
but he’s one of the richest businessmen in Yangzhou.

24:17.790 --> 24:19.240
In this case, he must be the one

24:19.650 --> 24:21.766
copying Yuntai's approach in Lingyuan.

24:21.790 --> 24:23.240
That's him.

24:24.100 --> 24:25.766
Now you, Mingyu and I

24:25.790 --> 24:28.430
are the top alliance in Nandu.

24:28.630 --> 24:30.490
But overnight,

24:30.880 --> 24:32.670
both families suffered greatly.

24:32.730 --> 24:34.490
Is this just a coincidence?

24:35.790 --> 24:37.126
No.

24:37.150 --> 24:39.176
No matter how capable Nangong Fang is,

24:39.200 --> 24:41.940
can he use the imperial edict to confront the Su family?

24:44.070 --> 24:45.910
What if that’s the case?

24:49.310 --> 24:51.256
The situation is unclear.

24:51.280 --> 24:52.656
If we act rashly,

24:52.680 --> 24:54.956
it will only cause more trouble to ourselves.

24:54.980 --> 24:56.430
Let's wait and see.

24:56.590 --> 24:59.150
No, this is serious.

24:59.270 --> 25:01.120
I must report it to Master.

25:00.820 --> 25:04.000
[Guanghui Bank]

25:09.070 --> 25:10.486
Uncle, you're finally back.

25:10.510 --> 25:11.846
I was looking for you.

25:11.870 --> 25:12.646
We have a guest,

25:12.670 --> 25:13.916
who has been waiting for you until this time.

25:13.940 --> 25:14.846
What guest?

25:14.870 --> 25:16.516
Can't you do business without me?

25:16.540 --> 25:17.990
From across the sea.

25:25.380 --> 25:26.880
That's a large sum.

25:28.270 --> 25:30.326
No wonder you came in person.

25:30.350 --> 25:32.230
When will the fortune arrive?

25:33.790 --> 25:35.126
The day after tomorrow.

25:35.150 --> 25:36.886
Three days from now at the latest.

25:36.910 --> 25:38.326
As usual,

25:38.350 --> 25:41.620
trade it in for food, weapons and medicine.

25:41.680 --> 25:43.326
Launder the rest

25:43.350 --> 25:44.486
and put them in my account.

25:44.510 --> 25:46.046
Sure, as usual.

25:46.070 --> 25:47.486
I'll take ten percent of the profit.

25:47.510 --> 25:48.846
For half a year.

25:48.870 --> 25:50.750
I promise your money...

25:54.000 --> 25:55.450
Guan,

25:55.540 --> 25:58.840
do you want to launder it faster or slower?

26:02.190 --> 26:03.326
What?

26:03.350 --> 26:05.006
Do you have a faster way?

26:05.030 --> 26:07.246
I do have a faster way now.

26:07.270 --> 26:08.486
But let me be clear.

26:08.510 --> 26:10.920
It's risky and you might lose your money.

26:12.510 --> 26:13.736
Tell me.

26:13.760 --> 26:15.246
A new bank opened.

26:15.270 --> 26:17.670
Ten percent of interest back for all deposit.

26:19.220 --> 26:20.930
What is he up to?

26:21.040 --> 26:22.706
He's giving back ten percent of interest.

26:22.730 --> 26:24.366
It's the Dafeng Bank across the street.

26:24.390 --> 26:28.126
But I don't know what the risks are.

26:28.150 --> 26:29.846
He dares to do business like that

26:29.870 --> 26:32.526
because he knew his competitor would take advantage of him.

26:32.550 --> 26:34.560
To be suspicious of each other.

26:34.590 --> 26:38.250
It depends on who's right on the timing.

26:40.790 --> 26:42.360
That means

26:42.910 --> 26:46.110
we might lose all of it.

26:48.330 --> 26:50.160
It's still on me if you lose money.

26:50.350 --> 26:51.800
You brat.

26:51.830 --> 26:53.910
You want to use me to do business.

26:55.250 --> 26:56.286
How about this?

26:56.310 --> 26:57.826
I'll pay for the loss.

26:57.850 --> 27:00.046
Give me two years. There won't be any interest.

27:00.070 --> 27:02.190
I'll pay you back all of the sum.

27:03.100 --> 27:07.086
But I'll get the ten percent profit.

27:07.110 --> 27:08.560
Nonsense!

27:08.900 --> 27:10.126
What's in it for me?

27:10.150 --> 27:11.356
Within ten days,

27:11.380 --> 27:12.270
Within ten days,

27:12.270 --> 27:14.390
I promise I’ll get all your money

27:14.390 --> 27:15.840
clean and refreshed.

27:18.940 --> 27:20.390
Deal.

27:21.740 --> 27:23.290
Deal.

27:28.110 --> 27:29.560
OK.

27:29.940 --> 27:33.070
We'll pick up the goods at the same place the day after tomorrow.

28:44.420 --> 28:45.980
Mr. Xiang,

28:47.310 --> 28:49.460
we finally meet.

28:53.110 --> 28:54.670
It's late at night.

28:55.350 --> 28:56.926
I don't know if you're a friend or foe.

28:56.950 --> 28:58.710
Please tell me your name.

28:59.110 --> 29:01.400
There are so many people in this world.

29:01.510 --> 29:03.716
It doesn't have to be either friend or foe.

29:03.740 --> 29:06.660
Why don't you make a guess, Mr. Yun?

29:07.310 --> 29:08.546
You're not an enemy?

29:08.570 --> 29:10.280
We are, sort of.

29:11.510 --> 29:13.100
Are you here to take my life?

29:13.310 --> 29:15.200
It depends on you.

29:17.740 --> 29:19.176
In that case,

29:19.200 --> 29:20.780
I'm quite sure.

29:21.510 --> 29:24.390
Are you from Lingyuan Sect?

29:31.110 --> 29:34.250
It seems that you have an intention.

29:34.590 --> 29:36.750
Otherwise, you would've taken out the dagger.

29:37.070 --> 29:38.750
You are really smart.

29:38.860 --> 29:41.850
No wonder my sister was attracted to you.

29:42.310 --> 29:45.980
Lingyuan Sect's master gave birth to a son and a daughter.

29:46.510 --> 29:48.230
The son's name is Kou Yuanjie.

29:52.350 --> 29:53.950
Nice to meet you, Mr. Kou.

29:54.970 --> 29:56.970
You're such a talent.

29:57.070 --> 29:58.926
With a few tactics,

29:58.950 --> 30:01.286
plenty of girls will fall for you.

30:01.310 --> 30:03.870
Why did you mess with Lingyuan's people?

30:04.380 --> 30:06.530
If my sister hadn't protected you,

30:06.630 --> 30:09.060
I would have killed you long ago.

30:09.270 --> 30:11.750
But now even if I don't do it,

30:12.000 --> 30:14.260
you'd be in great trouble.

30:14.460 --> 30:17.960
I'm the only one who can save you.

30:29.310 --> 30:30.850
Since that's the case,

30:31.700 --> 30:33.696
Mr. Kou, why don't you cut to the chase?

30:33.720 --> 30:36.246
Are you causing chaos in Nandu

30:36.270 --> 30:38.510
because of Wen Cong?

30:40.350 --> 30:43.060
Nangong Fang is the instigator.

30:45.510 --> 30:48.280
You don't have to tell me about it.

30:49.590 --> 30:53.310
I'm not only talking about Wen Cong being set up.

30:53.670 --> 30:54.760
Their real grudge

30:54.780 --> 30:57.310
could be traced back to 15 years ago.

30:57.410 --> 31:00.806
Back then, it was Nangong Fang who secretly caused

31:00.830 --> 31:04.150
Wen Cong to lose control of Nandu's business sector.

31:04.880 --> 31:06.526
They are huge enemies.

31:06.550 --> 31:07.926
Getting rid of him

31:07.950 --> 31:10.620
will be very beneficial to you.

31:10.830 --> 31:14.860
It does more good than harm to Yuntai.

31:15.530 --> 31:19.566
My father met an unknown guest.

31:19.590 --> 31:21.590
I'm afraid it's a name

31:22.190 --> 31:24.296
we both don't want to hear.

31:24.320 --> 31:25.770
It's called

31:27.050 --> 31:28.500
Lingyuan.

31:30.960 --> 31:32.430
In that case,

31:32.760 --> 31:35.846
Nangong Fang planned the east-coast land purchase case.

31:35.870 --> 31:37.320
Exactly.

31:42.110 --> 31:46.510
Your sister wanted to use me to restrain Nangong Fang.

31:46.550 --> 31:47.070
But why didn't she

31:47.070 --> 31:49.276
mention this past to me?

31:49.300 --> 31:50.736
15 years ago, how could

31:50.760 --> 31:53.646
my sister and I get involved in Lingyuan Sect?

31:53.670 --> 31:54.756
Besides, she has never had

31:54.780 --> 31:56.496
an ambition since she was young.

31:56.520 --> 31:58.660
She never cared about the affairs in Lingyuan.

31:59.900 --> 32:01.716
And even if she knows,

32:01.740 --> 32:03.396
she might not tell you.

32:03.420 --> 32:04.656
Why?

32:04.680 --> 32:07.446
How could she have the courage like a tough man?

32:07.470 --> 32:08.566
She used you

32:08.590 --> 32:10.990
to restrain Nangong Fang.

32:11.150 --> 32:13.376
How could she have the guts to tell you the conflicts in Lingyuan,

32:13.400 --> 32:16.660
let alone deciding to get rid of Nangong Fang?

32:17.110 --> 32:18.740
Get rid of Nangong Fang?

32:19.690 --> 32:21.340
Do you have the determination?

32:23.310 --> 32:25.156
I've said a lot,

32:25.180 --> 32:28.280
but I don't know if you are capable of going against him.

32:29.270 --> 32:30.750
Yun Xiang,

32:31.130 --> 32:33.200
if we don't form an alliance,

32:33.410 --> 32:36.810
you will die tonight.

32:55.180 --> 32:56.820
Getting rid of Nangong Fang.

32:58.690 --> 33:00.850
I can complete it by tomorrow.

33:02.700 --> 33:04.136
Really?

33:04.160 --> 33:07.370
Didn't your sister tell you

33:08.390 --> 33:09.990
I never break a promise?

33:15.350 --> 33:17.030
Since we want to form an alliance,

33:17.830 --> 33:19.766
I hope you can answer two questions.

33:19.790 --> 33:21.240
First,

33:21.510 --> 33:23.750
what is Nangong Fang's background?

33:24.510 --> 33:25.960
Second,

33:26.070 --> 33:28.390
your sister wanted to restrain him.

33:28.590 --> 33:29.830
Why would she join hands with him

33:29.830 --> 33:31.320
to confront me?

33:31.870 --> 33:34.500
How can I explain it in a few words?

33:34.620 --> 33:37.640
Take your time. I want to know.

33:44.670 --> 33:46.246
So you mean

33:46.270 --> 33:48.586
there are still remnants of Lingyuan in Nandu?

33:48.610 --> 33:49.716
Yes.

33:49.740 --> 33:50.796
As soon as I got the news,

33:50.820 --> 33:52.566
I went to the government office to find Mr. Shao.

33:52.590 --> 33:54.126
I came here hastily

33:54.150 --> 33:55.526
as soon as I knew you're visiting Her Highness.

33:55.550 --> 33:56.666
Do you have any evidence?

33:56.690 --> 33:57.606
No.

33:57.630 --> 33:58.436
Ridiculous.

33:58.460 --> 34:00.326
If they randomly testify like you,

34:00.350 --> 34:01.166
wouldn't that be...

34:01.190 --> 34:02.366
Mr. Shao,

34:02.390 --> 34:04.156
Mr. Yun has played a crucial role

34:04.180 --> 34:07.460
in the water ghost robbery case.

34:08.379 --> 34:10.169
But there's one thing I don't understand.

34:10.430 --> 34:12.596
Why are you trying so hard

34:12.620 --> 34:14.620
to go after these rebels of Lingyuan?

34:15.510 --> 34:17.545
Lingyuan's people are outrageous.

34:17.569 --> 34:19.090
They disregard the law.

34:19.390 --> 34:21.045
If we can get rid of this group of people

34:21.069 --> 34:22.726
by ourselves,

34:22.750 --> 34:25.030
we can bring peace to the people of Nandu.

34:25.109 --> 34:27.749
Isn't this what Your Highness, Magistrate Shao

34:27.870 --> 34:30.846
and Prince Fu want to see?

34:30.870 --> 34:31.966
Indeed.

34:31.990 --> 34:34.510
If Father knows the rebels of Lingyuan

34:34.510 --> 34:35.835
are still secretly hiding in Nandu,

34:35.859 --> 34:37.499
he would investigate it thoroughly as well.

34:38.410 --> 34:41.326
But you have no evidence.

34:41.350 --> 34:43.196
How can I trust you?

34:43.220 --> 34:45.085
I don't have solid evidence yet,

34:45.109 --> 34:46.996
but I've already set up a bait.

34:47.020 --> 34:48.620
This can't be delayed.

34:49.010 --> 34:51.916
Would you like to arrest the suspect

34:51.940 --> 34:54.100
with me?

34:55.160 --> 34:58.250
What exactly is the bait?

35:38.970 --> 35:40.500
Someone asked me to save you.

35:42.070 --> 35:43.520
It's Kou Yuanjie.

35:44.550 --> 35:46.000
He's back.

35:57.840 --> 35:59.246
That's right.

35:59.270 --> 36:01.240
I might be using you.

36:11.790 --> 36:13.310
You're not afraid of death.

36:13.580 --> 36:15.700
I'm giving you a chance to live.

36:15.850 --> 36:17.340
Don't tell me you don't want it.

36:26.340 --> 36:27.960
He's been waiting for you.

36:28.940 --> 36:30.970
He asked you to wear this cloak.

36:33.700 --> 36:35.350
I only bribed the guards.

36:36.050 --> 36:38.120
The rest is up to you.

36:44.060 --> 36:49.020
[Shao's Residence]

36:55.790 --> 36:57.126
Keep the meat away

36:57.150 --> 36:58.870
so that he won't eat too much again.

37:01.890 --> 37:03.326
You should leave a space in the center.

37:03.350 --> 37:04.606
It's for the drunken crab.

37:04.630 --> 37:06.176
It's Father's favorite.

37:06.200 --> 37:06.766
Yes, Your Highness.

37:06.790 --> 37:08.166
By the way,

37:08.190 --> 37:09.646
the wine is a bit cold.

37:09.670 --> 37:10.846
Father has a poor stomach.

37:10.870 --> 37:12.326
He needs to drink something warm.

37:12.350 --> 37:13.800
Yes, Your Highness.

37:19.460 --> 37:20.356
I’m very sorry.

37:20.380 --> 37:22.370
- I bumped into the dish in her hand.
- I’m very sorry.

37:23.980 --> 37:25.740
Prince Fu is here.

37:28.870 --> 37:30.320
Mingzhu.

37:31.390 --> 37:32.636
Mingzhu.

37:32.660 --> 37:34.240
Where is she?

37:34.900 --> 37:36.350
Mingzhu.

37:37.710 --> 37:39.090
All right, get up.

37:39.110 --> 37:40.406
No need for courtesy.

37:40.430 --> 37:41.990
Get up.

37:42.170 --> 37:43.850
[Prince Fu]

37:43.580 --> 37:45.030
Father.

37:46.100 --> 37:47.460
My daughter, come here.

37:47.480 --> 37:49.490
Let me see if you've changed.

37:49.790 --> 37:50.686
Father.

37:50.710 --> 37:52.150
You finally came to see me.

37:52.150 --> 37:53.326
Really?

37:53.350 --> 37:54.790
Who wrote a fake letter

37:54.790 --> 37:57.180
and sneaked away?

37:58.260 --> 37:59.826
I'm fine,

37:59.850 --> 38:01.166
other than missing you.

38:01.190 --> 38:02.196
Okay.

38:02.220 --> 38:04.670
Only Gongquan can grant you full autonomy

38:05.160 --> 38:06.366
and take you to solve cases.

38:06.390 --> 38:08.270
Share with me when you have time.

38:08.270 --> 38:09.646
What trouble did you get into?

38:09.670 --> 38:10.746
Father.

38:10.770 --> 38:12.536
You know better than me about

38:12.560 --> 38:13.846
what I did in Nandu.

38:13.870 --> 38:15.320
You don't need me to tell you.

38:16.580 --> 38:18.760
But I can tell you

38:18.780 --> 38:20.876
about my progress recently.

38:20.900 --> 38:23.386
It's great that you made progress.

38:23.410 --> 38:25.806
I won't let you go until you finish.

38:25.830 --> 38:27.280
What's going on?

38:28.360 --> 38:29.206
Look.

38:29.230 --> 38:31.310
Father, your favorite drunken crab.

38:31.370 --> 38:33.246
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

38:33.270 --> 38:33.756
It's all my fault.

38:33.780 --> 38:34.686
Enough.

38:34.710 --> 38:35.670
Don't think that the Prince

38:35.670 --> 38:36.746
is as harsh as you think.

38:36.770 --> 38:37.396
Right, Father?

38:37.420 --> 38:39.276
Yes. Get up.

38:39.300 --> 38:40.486
It's okay.

38:40.510 --> 38:42.010
Get up.

38:42.710 --> 38:44.160
Get up.

38:45.820 --> 38:47.806
Get up.

38:47.830 --> 38:49.280
Clean it up.

38:49.710 --> 38:51.160
Yes.

38:51.950 --> 38:52.846
Isn't it settled now?

38:52.870 --> 38:53.986
You like to meddle a lot.

38:54.010 --> 38:56.610
Let me see what delicious food you prepared.

38:57.170 --> 38:58.620
Let's see.

38:58.870 --> 38:59.846
How is it?

38:59.870 --> 39:02.270
Aren't these your favorite?

39:02.680 --> 39:04.440
It smells so good.

39:04.940 --> 39:06.296
Father, have a seat.

39:06.320 --> 39:07.770
Here.

39:07.840 --> 39:09.286
It's really good.

39:09.310 --> 39:10.426
Father.

39:10.450 --> 39:11.536
Beidu is good,

39:11.560 --> 39:13.786
but it's not as good as the taste of our hometown.

39:13.810 --> 39:15.590
Sit down.

39:17.230 --> 39:18.756
Tell me about it.

39:18.780 --> 39:21.326
Do you feel at ease staying here?

39:21.350 --> 39:22.550
Yes.

39:22.550 --> 39:24.326
Father, don't worry.

39:24.350 --> 39:25.006
Father.

39:25.030 --> 39:27.190
The dishes are getting cold. Hurry up and eat them.

39:27.450 --> 39:28.686
Mingzhu.

39:28.710 --> 39:30.160
Here's the thing.

39:30.190 --> 39:31.856
I just arrived in Nandu today,

39:31.880 --> 39:33.056
and accepted an invitation.

39:33.080 --> 39:35.280
I do have something important to do.

39:35.430 --> 39:37.646
I'd better eat with the others.

39:37.670 --> 39:38.846
Father.

39:38.870 --> 39:40.276
Who are they?

39:40.300 --> 39:40.956
Sit down.

39:40.980 --> 39:43.146
You're leaving before spending enough time with your daughter.

39:43.170 --> 39:43.900
No, see.

39:43.900 --> 39:46.270
I have something important to tell you.

39:46.380 --> 39:47.766
It's just a friend,

39:47.790 --> 39:49.416
who I haven't seen for a long time.

39:49.440 --> 39:50.616
How about this?

39:50.640 --> 39:52.006
Don't go there,

39:52.030 --> 39:53.826
or take me with you.

39:53.850 --> 39:54.376
No.

39:54.400 --> 39:56.880
I do have something important to do.

39:57.310 --> 39:58.156
Father.

39:58.180 --> 39:59.306
Let me go with you.

39:59.330 --> 40:00.406
Fine. Fine. Fine.

40:00.430 --> 40:01.766
I'll let you

40:01.790 --> 40:03.310
come with me.

40:05.470 --> 40:07.506
I think Gongquan

40:07.530 --> 40:10.526
is probably hiding from your unruly temper.

40:10.550 --> 40:12.800
Am I right? Right?

40:13.490 --> 40:14.446
Father.

40:14.470 --> 40:16.820
He doesn't need to go so far to hide from me.

40:16.930 --> 40:19.250
He went to the east coast to investigate a case.

40:19.790 --> 40:21.316
What's the case about?

40:21.340 --> 40:22.876
I don't know.

40:22.900 --> 40:26.020
Maybe it's related to the water ghost robbery.

40:26.480 --> 40:28.926
But he can really live up to

40:28.950 --> 40:30.566
his reputation of the Detective of Jiangnan.

40:30.590 --> 40:32.720
He really can infer from the tiniest clue.

40:33.260 --> 40:34.710
But Father,

40:35.250 --> 40:37.616
have you been in touch with him lately?

40:37.640 --> 40:39.290
I don't know what he's investigating.

40:40.520 --> 40:41.486
He's an imperial guard.

40:41.510 --> 40:42.670
I'm an idle prince.

40:42.670 --> 40:44.710
Why would I have the time to ask him about it?

40:46.230 --> 40:47.680
Let's go.

40:47.830 --> 40:49.280
Let's go together.

41:36.110 --> 41:38.510
Don't worry. I'm here.

41:39.670 --> 41:41.700
It's okay. It's okay.

41:43.470 --> 41:44.920
It's okay.

41:46.280 --> 41:47.730
It's all in the past.

41:56.910 --> 41:58.630
Yun Xiang told me

41:58.890 --> 42:01.410
you would rather kill yourself than speak.

42:01.870 --> 42:03.580
I didn't believe it at first.

42:05.020 --> 42:07.626
Yuewu, why are you so foolish?

42:07.650 --> 42:09.280
How could I not save you?

42:15.740 --> 42:17.166
I know official soldiers are following you.

42:17.190 --> 42:18.640
It's okay.

42:18.750 --> 42:20.200
Have a seat.

42:25.470 --> 42:28.430
Yuewu, you've suffered a lot.

42:30.350 --> 42:31.746
Don't worry.

42:31.770 --> 42:33.726
I have a well-prepared plan.

42:33.750 --> 42:35.116
Listen to me carefully.

42:35.140 --> 42:36.660
You will be safe tonight.

42:36.770 --> 42:39.340
Do you remember the bank

42:41.340 --> 42:42.816
opposite to Guanghui Bank,

42:42.840 --> 42:45.120
called Dafeng Bank?

42:45.260 --> 42:47.020
I ordered someone to establish it.

42:47.380 --> 42:49.756
Go there to avoid official soldiers.

42:49.780 --> 42:51.806
Go to the second floor from the southeast corner.

42:51.830 --> 42:54.550
Leave the rest to them.

43:21.700 --> 43:23.246
Don't worry about me.

43:23.270 --> 43:25.900
We'll meet outside the city tomorrow morning.

44:09.880 --> 44:11.926
Come, let's drink.

44:11.950 --> 44:13.400
Come on.

44:19.360 --> 44:20.810
Please.

44:30.980 --> 44:33.846
This must be Princess Mingzhu,

44:33.870 --> 44:34.886
Prince Fu's daughter, right?

44:34.910 --> 44:36.360
Yes.

44:36.880 --> 44:38.116
I heard that

44:38.140 --> 44:40.016
Your Highness is gifted

44:40.040 --> 44:41.476
and gorgeous.

44:41.500 --> 44:43.686
I didn’t expect that after seeing Your Highness today,

44:43.710 --> 44:46.510
the rumor didn't even describe a fraction of your charm.

44:48.180 --> 44:49.246
Mingzhu.

44:49.270 --> 44:51.310
Let me introduce.

44:51.710 --> 44:54.910
This is Mr. Nangong.

44:57.640 --> 44:59.286
Only a few people

44:59.310 --> 45:01.910
can compete with him

45:01.950 --> 45:03.710
in the business sector in Nandu.

45:05.350 --> 45:07.506
He was my business friend.

45:07.530 --> 45:08.726
No wonder.

45:08.750 --> 45:11.316
I prepared a table of delicious dishes.

45:11.340 --> 45:13.550
Father turned them down.

45:14.470 --> 45:17.736
But I'm more interested in

45:17.760 --> 45:19.280
the girl next to you.

45:21.190 --> 45:23.870
What is the reason, Your Highness?

45:24.380 --> 45:27.146
The hairpin on your hair is very exquisite.

45:27.170 --> 45:29.380
I wonder where you got it from.

45:29.790 --> 45:31.126
It's just an ordinary object.

45:31.150 --> 45:32.106
If you like it,

45:32.130 --> 45:34.610
I can buy it for you next time.

45:35.840 --> 45:37.186
I’m sorry.

45:37.210 --> 45:38.126
I didn't introduce her.

45:38.150 --> 45:41.376
This is my right-hand man in Nandu.

45:41.400 --> 45:44.140
Miss Kou, Kou Lianyi.

46:15.700 --> 46:16.586
My lord.

46:16.610 --> 46:18.060
it's time to close the net.

46:18.890 --> 46:22.090
Yun Xiang is very suspicious.

46:23.090 --> 46:24.720
What should we do?

46:24.830 --> 46:26.966
Since Her Highness has agreed,

46:26.990 --> 46:28.596
just do as she said.

46:28.620 --> 46:30.070
Yes, My lord.

46:45.990 --> 46:47.440
Mr. Nangong,

46:47.670 --> 46:49.966
arguably, I shouldn't question the sum of money

46:49.990 --> 46:51.270
you have earned for me these years.

46:51.270 --> 46:53.070
Why are Nangong Fang and Lady Kou here?

46:53.070 --> 46:55.810
Isn't it a bit absurd for a bank

46:57.050 --> 46:59.280
to give back interest?

47:01.050 --> 47:03.406
Don't worry, Your Highness.

47:03.430 --> 47:05.886
This is a trap for the enemy.

47:05.910 --> 47:07.920
The business world is like a battlefield.

47:08.790 --> 47:10.240
Who is it?

47:49.700 --> 47:51.036
How dare you!

47:51.060 --> 47:53.300
How dare you assassinate Prince Fu?

48:04.420 --> 48:07.310
What is the bait you just mentioned?

48:08.230 --> 48:09.950
The bait I mentioned

48:10.000 --> 48:13.220
is the female bandit from Lingyuan.

48:20.670 --> 48:21.506
Arrest them all!

48:21.530 --> 48:23.230
Don't let anyone go!

48:29.990 --> 48:30.616
Your Highness.

48:30.640 --> 48:32.096
I'm late to the rescue.

48:32.120 --> 48:34.560
Death penalty!

48:35.750 --> 48:37.630
Shao Yiheng.
